  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n((103²-101²))/(102)\n\nWe can simplify it as follows:\n\n((103²-101²))/(102)\n\n⇒ ((103+101)(103-101))/(102)\n\n⇒ \\\\(204 times 2)/(102)\n\n⇒ \\\\(408)/(102) = 4\n\n**So, the expression evaluates to 4.**",
